1762   DAFB             ;**************************************************************************
1763   DAFB             ;* Adds a new thread to the VM. The data for this routine is contained 
1764   DAFB             ;* directly after the jsr to this routine. A single byte follows the
1765   DAFB             ;* jsr and is the timer byte used for the delay until the thread starts.
1766   DAFB             ;* The actual address directly after the timer byte is where the thread
1767   DAFB             ;* will start running. Example:
1768   DAFB             ;*
1769   DAFB             ;*  jsr addthread
1770   DAFB             ;*    .db 05        ;This is the timer byte
1771   DAFB             ;*  ldaa #FF        ;This code is executed as the thread.
