4486   E95D             ;***********************************************
4487   E95D             ;* This routine is spawned as a thread when the
4488   E95D             ;* credits in memory space do not match
4489   E95D             ;* the number of credits in the CMOS RAM. It 
4490   E95D             ;* Takes care of bringing them equal in a timely
4491   E95D             ;* fashion and calling the game ROM hook each
4492   E95D             ;* time a credit is added to the memory location. 
